        <p>Metairs. Hedges !X Butler, lb* well-known Win Merchants of 15, Regent-street, Lotdon W., hem received from their correspondent• in the varioirs Wine districta particulars of the 1911 Vintage. In most dig tricte • cold Spring, unfavourable to the vine', was followed by an exceptionally glorious S.l rumor, with gentle rains some time before the Vintage. There be not been for many years such a splendid Vintage, and we are certain of hiving a very grand wine although the quantity will be small.</p>
