        <p>Are you suffering from nervous prostration, sr emis, indigestion, wrecked nerves, stomach and kidney iron Vet, loos of flmb, or any form of nerve or bodily weak OM ? II so, a trial of Dr. Cassell's Tablets for Weak and Nervous Prople, the speediest and most effe tive run, is yours for the asking. Dr. Forshaw, Ph.D., D.Sc.. Baltimore House, Bradford, writes : " A remarkably potential remedy." Scud 2d in atamp, for pocking, etc., to Dr. Caseelre Co. Fig St_ W.. Manchester, arid a sample box will he sent. Large Buses at all chemists at 100., till and 2,9.</p>
