        <p>To-day the programme is a diversified one owing to the first ronnd of the Lancashire Cup. The fixture list is as f Mows : Hunslet • Australians. LANCASHIRE CUP. St. Helens v Salford. Barrow v Oldlism. Rochdale Hornets v Swinton. Broughton Rangers v Runcorn. • Widnes v Warrington.</p>
