        <p>CATCHFORD V. OUGHTRINGTON PARK.</p>
        <p>Played at lhelvrall-lane, Latchford. Play opened fast and even. After clever runs by the home right wing Latchford opened their account with a goo' goal. The Park retaliated and missed a capital opening. Midfield play followed for a time. Before the interval Latch- ford increased their lead to two goals to nil. Oa the re-start 0 ightrington Pork applied considerable pressure, but finished badly. Latchford again took up the running and after a good work by the whole of their forwards quickly added a couple of points. Aroused by these reverGes the Park played desperately, but it was not until ten minutes off time when they met with any success one of the home backs handling. The penalty being Maisel to the full the game endei : Latchford, four ; Oughtrington Park, one.</p>
