        <p>The fourth and fifth rounds of the annual handion were cumpleted on Saturday. Details of the day's play are appended</p>
        <p>_ FOURTH ROUND. A Gleave, P and K Woods, Fletchers C Perry, Ropery..... ..... 15 I.` Hackett, Fletcher/L ,10 A Cleave, Whymaus 15 A Scott, Ltngford l2 W 8011, Whiteaross l5 D Armitagg,(Nol) P&amp;K 13 Ii Bromley, Longford l5 .1 Bradshaw, P &amp; K 13 J Hardman, Guests Plampton,Grappenhall 15 IV Berry, Itylands lO C Taylor, Rylands • l5 C Lunt, Fennel-street 9 T Jackson, Crosflelds...... 15 0 Crozier, CLC E Blackledge, Rylands... 15 H Roughley, Rylands 3 R Barnett, P and K CI Mealia, Monks F Boscow, Richmonds E Shaw, Fletchers l5 W Taylor, Naylors 8 W Langley, Ryland* l5 T Wells, Walkers F' Shaw, Corporation ... 15 J Litherland. Rylands 11 It Holbrook, P and K 15 J Appleton,Whitecross 10 H Bennett, P and K H Daintith,Fletchers ... 15 G Andrews, Orford T Maskill, Rylands A Cleave, Whitecrosa J Lewis. Corporation .7 Smith, Richmonds l5 G Hatton, Whitecross 14 R Savory, Rylands B Jenniogs, Crosflelds G F Rice, Corporation... 15 A Warburton, W'cross 8 .1 Ashton, Firth l5 J Barton, Ropery T Clare, Rylands W Andrews, Orford F Peecham, Crosfields, a bye. FIFTH ROUND. _</p>
        <p>A Glee's I F Beeball A (heave l _ Holbrook 12</p>
