      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1911-10-21_WidnesExaminer_art0103" n="art0103">
        <head>GENERAL YIN-CHANG.</head>
        <p>GENERAL YIN-CHANG.</p>
        <p>An Imperial edict issued in Pekin has directed General Yin-Chang, the General- issimo of the Northern Army and Vice- President of the War Board, to proceed to Hankow immediately with 12,000 Imperial troops in order to restore the authority of the Government.</p>
