        <p>The total Liabilities in this Department on Capital Account are .5..374,403 14s. 3d., and after providing for Sinking Fund and Interest Payments only £1,931 12s. 6.1. profit was made. In view of the further extensions being made we consider that the greatest economy should be exercised in the working of this Department. Deputation expenses amount t) £2O Is. to London re Extensions. The reserve fund now stands at £4,127 12s. 2d. and the working balance £6,850 Os. d. 10,512 4 3 I Income 6,205 11 5 I 2,667 13 1</p>
