        <p>The Reserve Fund now stands at £9,064 3e. 10d. As a suggestion was made some little time ago that the Reserve Fund should be applopriated to redaction of Rates, we should like to point out that in view of the fact that there is no Depreciation Fund in connection with this Department, and also in view of the fact that the track will shortly have to be relaid, it seems to us short-sighted finance to tamper with the Reserve Find. We notice Deputation Expenses amounting to .£ll odd.</p>
